{"4130970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gawble Gunrange", "steam_appid": 4130970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/extras/65c0084bb8933176cc7c69865088785a.avif?t=1772240020\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gawble Gunrange is a fast-paced, pick up and play, first person shooter! Jump, sprint, go<i> pew pew</i> alongside the colourful Gawbles in a variety of worlds. Test your trigger finger as you aim to shoot all targets in each level, while simultaneously trying to get a best time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/extras/40bbecb7fc54231aaa5e07377f80e64e.avif?t=1772240020\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blaze across 30 levels -</strong> Set across 4, vibrant, whacky worlds, Gawble Gunrange is constantly throwing new environmental challenges and set pieces in your path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up and play -</strong> Whether you're a seasoned veteran or new to the genre, Gawble Gunrange is designed to be a seamless experience where you'll master the controls quickly and start blasting away in no time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills -</strong> Don't let the colorful visuals fool you, Gawble Gunrange will push your reflexes to their limits. To achieve a perfect 3-star rating on each level you'll need to master every challenge that comes your way!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/extras/65c0084bb8933176cc7c69865088785a.avif?t=1772240020\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gawble Gunrange is a fast-paced, pick up and play, first person shooter! Jump, sprint, go<i> pew pew</i> alongside the colourful Gawbles in a variety of worlds. Test your trigger finger as you aim to shoot all targets in each level, while simultaneously trying to get a best time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/extras/40bbecb7fc54231aaa5e07377f80e64e.avif?t=1772240020\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blaze across 30 levels -</strong> Set across 4, vibrant, whacky worlds, Gawble Gunrange is constantly throwing new environmental challenges and set pieces in your path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up and play -</strong> Whether you're a seasoned veteran or new to the genre, Gawble Gunrange is designed to be a seamless experience where you'll master the controls quickly and start blasting away in no time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills -</strong> Don't let the colorful visuals fool you, Gawble Gunrange will push your reflexes to their limits. To achieve a perfect 3-star rating on each level you'll need to master every challenge that comes your way!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Gawble Gunrange is a fast paced, time-attack focused, first person shooter!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/d7ce8c70cc6bdf3509b9bc6b4a3f7af9a5ac4fb6/header.jpg?t=1772240020", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130970/08cece3c70e276e5cca43f7c102646280ecb0eeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772240020", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite